---
import BrandLayout from '../layouts/BrandLayout.astro'

const nav = [
  { label: 'Services', href: '#services' },
  { label: 'Approach', href: '#approach' },
  { label: 'Work', href: '#work' },
  { label: 'About', href: '#about' },
]
---

<BrandLayout
  brand="signal"
  brandName="SIGNAL. by SIRYUS"
  title="SIGNAL. by SIRYUS | Make your message matter."
  description="A storytelling-led marketing and growth agency for brands, companies, and organizations."
  canonical="https://www.siryushub.com/signal"
  nav={nav}
  contactHref="#contact"
  contactLabel="Let's talk"
  logo="/brand/signal/wordmark.png"
  logoAlt="SIGNAL. by SIRYUS"
>
  <section class="brand-hero">
    <h1>Make your message matter.</h1>
    <div>
      <p class="brand-hero__intro">Good marketing starts with a story people care about. We find that story, shape the strategy, and build campaigns that move people to act.</p>
      <div class="brand-hero__actions">
        <a class="brand-action" href="#contact">Tell us what you are building</a>
        <a class="brand-action brand-action--quiet" href="#approach">See our approach</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brand-section" id="approach" data-reveal>
    <div class="brand-section__head">
      <h2>Find the story. Shape the strategy. Move the message.</h2>
      <p>We start with what is true and useful. Then we turn it into clear messages, focused campaigns, and work that can be measured.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="brand-list">
      <article class="brand-panel brand-panel--narrow"><div><h3>Find</h3><p>We listen, research, and uncover the idea people should remember.</p></div></article>
      <article class="brand-panel brand-panel--wide"><div><h3>Shape</h3><p>We build the message, the plan, and the creative direction around that idea.</p></div></article>
      <article class="brand-panel brand-panel--wide"><div><h3>Move</h3><p>We carry the story into campaigns, content, email, and the channels that fit.</p></div></article>
      <article class="brand-panel brand-panel--narrow"><div><h3>Learn</h3><p>We look at the response, learn what worked, and improve the next move.</p></div></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brand-section" id="services" data-reveal>
    <div class="brand-section__head">
      <h2>Strategy with a pulse.</h2>
      <p>Each engagement starts with the real problem. The service mix follows from there.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="brand-services">
      <article class="brand-service"><h3>Story and strategy</h3><p>Positioning, audience thinking, campaign direction, and a clear reason for every move.</p></article>
      <article class="brand-service"><h3>Messaging and copy</h3><p>Words that sound human, stay consistent, and help people understand what matters.</p></article>
      <article class="brand-service"><h3>Marketing campaigns</h3><p>Joined-up planning across the channels and moments that make sense for the goal.</p></article>
      <article class="brand-service"><h3>Email and CRM</h3><p>Useful journeys, thoughtful messages, and better ways to keep real relationships warm.</p></article>
      <article class="brand-service"><h3>Content and creative</h3><p>Clear concepts and content systems built to carry one strong story over time.</p></article>
      <article class="brand-service"><h3>Growth and measurement</h3><p>Practical tests, useful signals, and reporting that helps the next decision.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brand-section" id="work" data-reveal>
    <div class="brand-callout">
      <h2>Work should earn attention.</h2>
      <p>Public case studies will appear here only when the work and permissions are ready. Until then, we would rather show a clear method than invent a result.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brand-section" id="about" data-reveal>
    <div class="brand-section__head">
      <h2>Storytelling is not decoration.</h2>
      <p>It is how people make sense of a brand, remember a message, and decide what to do next. SIGNAL. connects that human truth with practical marketing.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brand-section" id="contact" data-reveal>
    <div class="brand-section__head">
      <h2>Tell us what you are building.</h2>
      <p>Share the goal, the challenge, and where you feel stuck. We will respond with a clear next step.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="brand-action" href="/contact">Start a conversation</a>
  </section>
</BrandLayout>
